@LogiTrack_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@itemId = 0
@orderId = 0

GET {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/inventory

### Create inventory (copy returned itemId to delete below)
POST {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Pallet Jack","quantity":12,"location":"Warehouse A"}

### Replace ID with the created itemId
DELETE {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/{{itemId}}

###
GET {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/orders

### Create an order with two NEW inventory items
POST {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName":"Samir","items":[{"name":"Box","quantity":2,"location":"Warehouse A"},{"name":"Pallet","quantity":1,"location":"Warehouse B"}]}

### Replace ID with the created orderId
GET {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Deleting the order preserves its inventory items
DELETE {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
